WEBVTT

01:13.000 --> 01:18.280
[Meet Yourself]

01:20.000 --> 01:24.280
[Episode 11]

01:34.817 --> 01:36.497
Should we help her?

01:36.577 --> 01:37.243
No.

01:37.267 --> 01:38.297
She can do it.

01:39.507 --> 01:40.483
We'd better not intervene

01:40.507 --> 01:41.547
unless the baby is in the wrong position.

01:49.387 --> 01:52.447
♫ In the air, my memories flow ♫

01:52.447 --> 01:55.067
♫ Faces in a row ♫

01:55.187 --> 01:57.767
♫ Take a long way home ♫

01:58.607 --> 02:05.207
♫ But all of these remind me to believe ♫

02:05.527 --> 02:08.687
♫ No one will stay or leave ♫

02:08.927 --> 02:15.807
♫ And then all of these remind me to receive ♫

02:16.347 --> 02:19.907
♫ Life we can see ♫

02:27.737 --> 02:28.987
Thanks for your help.

02:29.297 --> 02:30.737
I've injected the anti-Tetanus vaccine

02:30.947 --> 02:32.297
and fed mare milk.

02:32.337 --> 02:33.267
The foal is safe.

02:33.267 --> 02:34.427
The situation is controlled.

02:34.547 --> 02:35.403
Thank you very much.

02:35.427 --> 02:36.433
Give me a call

02:36.457 --> 02:37.177
if there is an emergency.

02:37.177 --> 02:38.177
Okay.

02:47.367 --> 02:52.427
♫ The sun will rise and fall ♫

02:59.497 --> 03:00.433
Xie Zhiyao.

03:00.457 --> 03:01.403
Come look!

03:01.427 --> 03:02.827
The foal stands up.

03:08.457 --> 03:09.617
Amazing, right?

03:09.897 --> 03:11.057
The foal can stand up

03:11.057 --> 03:11.867
shortly after birth.

03:11.867 --> 03:13.147
That's the only way to suckle.

03:13.177 --> 03:14.297
An hour later,

03:14.297 --> 03:16.267
it would go out with the male.

03:29.177 --> 03:30.387
Lingdang.

03:30.897 --> 03:32.177
See that?

03:32.337 --> 03:33.177
The foal must stand up

03:33.177 --> 03:34.617
so as to suckle.

03:35.737 --> 03:37.107
How tough it is!

03:44.897 --> 03:46.857
Why am I doing this?

03:46.947 --> 03:48.057
Aunt Gui asks Uncle Zeqing home

03:48.057 --> 03:48.827
for dinner.

03:48.827 --> 03:50.507
He'd keep watch at night.

03:51.867 --> 03:54.547
I mean, what am I doing?

03:54.577 --> 03:56.123
You are very welcome.

03:56.147 --> 03:58.057
Consider that a ticket for witnessing
the birth of life.

04:01.497 --> 04:02.667
Dinnertime!

04:06.457 --> 04:08.147
I saw you cry this afternoon.

04:08.987 --> 04:10.337
I was touched.

04:10.907 --> 04:12.787
It is a rare scene for kids

04:12.787 --> 04:14.233
who grow up in a city like you.

04:14.257 --> 04:14.907
For us,

04:14.907 --> 04:17.883
our family always keeps herds and birds.

04:17.907 --> 04:20.337
Chopping firewood,

04:20.377 --> 04:21.347
picking up mushrooms,

04:21.347 --> 04:22.587
farming the land,

04:22.587 --> 04:23.747
we're used to them.

04:23.787 --> 04:24.963
I'm not a city girl.

04:24.987 --> 04:26.307
I was born in a town.

04:26.587 --> 04:27.907
My grandma lives in the countryside.

04:27.907 --> 04:28.547
When I was a kid,

04:28.547 --> 04:30.963
I'd visit her during vacations.

04:30.987 --> 04:31.737
I used to catch fish

04:31.737 --> 04:33.217
in the brooks!

04:33.467 --> 04:35.387
I even hatched eggs myself!

04:36.377 --> 04:38.147
How did you do that?

04:38.427 --> 04:40.377
I put eggs in my inside pockets.

04:40.377 --> 04:41.107
I kept holding them

04:41.107 --> 04:42.827
with my hands except for mealtime.

04:44.467 --> 04:45.987
My grandma said people cannot hatch eggs.

04:45.987 --> 04:47.387
But my sister said we could.

04:47.587 --> 04:50.057
My sister said most people cannot

04:50.057 --> 04:52.387
because they lack persistence.

04:52.617 --> 04:54.067
Whose opinion did you believe?

04:55.257 --> 04:57.537
I wanted to prove my persistence.

04:58.227 --> 04:59.203
And?

04:59.227 --> 05:00.777
And the chicken came out.

05:02.257 --> 05:03.323
Really?

05:03.347 --> 05:04.347
For real!

05:04.987 --> 05:06.827
You are full of surprises.

05:07.787 --> 05:08.947
It's true!

05:14.737 --> 05:15.737
Hongmi.

05:16.377 --> 05:18.297
Can you hold them for ten minutes for me?

05:18.297 --> 05:19.617
I'll take a quick shower.

05:19.617 --> 05:21.467
You always ask me to hold them for you.

05:21.467 --> 05:22.467
When the chicken comes out,

05:22.467 --> 05:23.867
they'd be mine! I'll eat them.

05:23.867 --> 05:25.387
You can't!

05:25.697 --> 05:26.667
Fine. Off you go.

05:26.667 --> 05:28.307
You have ten minutes.

05:28.737 --> 05:29.737
Hurry up.

05:57.547 --> 05:58.987
I swapped the eggs

05:58.987 --> 06:00.537
with boiled ones.

06:05.227 --> 06:06.867
What about the raw eggs?

06:07.547 --> 06:08.297
I put them

06:08.297 --> 06:09.547
in the henhouse.

06:09.547 --> 06:11.017
I'm afraid she'd break them.

06:17.057 --> 06:18.187
Have some more.

06:20.257 --> 06:21.467
A hen only takes care

06:21.467 --> 06:23.347
of the chicks hatched by itself.

06:23.347 --> 06:25.227
So, before the chick comes out,

06:25.227 --> 06:27.457
we must put the egg in the henhouse.

06:31.377 --> 06:33.417
Turn around. Don't look.

06:38.107 --> 06:40.187
No peeping!

06:40.297 --> 06:41.113
Hongmi.

06:41.137 --> 06:42.057
Watch Dou.

06:42.057 --> 06:43.507
Make sure she won't peep.

06:43.547 --> 06:44.827
Go away.

06:54.937 --> 06:55.937
Alright.

06:56.107 --> 06:58.537
Just wait for the chicks to come out.

07:01.497 --> 07:02.523
Hongmi!

07:02.547 --> 07:03.577
Look!

07:04.467 --> 07:05.323
Good for you!

07:05.347 --> 07:07.657
I'll nominate you General Hatching.

07:09.427 --> 07:11.067
When did you find it out?

07:11.137 --> 07:12.827
In middle school.

07:12.867 --> 07:14.867
Hongmi was about to take Gaokao.

07:15.667 --> 07:16.227
My dad said

07:16.227 --> 07:18.537
she could go to Fudan University.

07:18.667 --> 07:20.707
Then she started laughing,

07:20.817 --> 07:21.763
saying that I should go there.

07:21.787 --> 07:24.067
Because Fudan sounds likes hatching in Chinese.

07:24.377 --> 07:26.507
Hongmi is really good at keeping secrets.

07:29.257 --> 07:31.057
She always gives me advice

07:31.057 --> 07:32.897
on every decision I make.

08:15.257 --> 08:16.003
Is it too tight?

08:16.027 --> 08:17.027
Nope.

08:17.737 --> 08:18.257
Xiaochun.

08:18.257 --> 08:18.787
I washed the dishes.

08:18.787 --> 08:19.897
I'm heading to work.

08:20.027 --> 08:22.353
Xiaoxia, take me with you.

08:22.377 --> 08:23.257
I'm heading to work.

08:23.257 --> 08:23.817
You can't come.

08:23.817 --> 08:25.323
Why not play with Guobao and others?

08:25.347 --> 08:28.233
Tuotuo invites Guobao, Huzi, and me

08:28.257 --> 08:30.113
to the cafe for cakes.

08:30.137 --> 08:31.137
Wait for her.

08:31.137 --> 08:32.537
I'm braiding her hair. Almost done.

08:32.777 --> 08:34.017
So troublesome.

08:36.987 --> 08:38.387
In a minute.

08:41.137 --> 08:41.993
Xiaochun.

08:42.017 --> 08:42.993
It's Mr. Bandy-legged.

08:43.017 --> 08:45.083
Don't you call my dad's names.

08:45.107 --> 08:46.177
Apologize.

08:46.257 --> 08:47.323
I'm sorry.

08:47.347 --> 08:48.067
Pick it up.

08:48.067 --> 08:49.587
I need to use the bathroom.

08:52.987 --> 08:54.057
Dad!

08:54.347 --> 08:55.627
Do you miss me?

08:55.657 --> 08:58.083
I do! When will you come?

08:58.107 --> 08:59.393
Where's mom?

08:59.417 --> 09:01.017
She's by my side,

09:01.017 --> 09:02.987
braiding my hair.

09:02.987 --> 09:04.867
I have a date today.

09:05.347 --> 09:06.137
That's not a date.

09:06.137 --> 09:07.867
Don't be silly.

09:08.947 --> 09:10.563
Alright. There you go.

09:10.587 --> 09:11.227
Let me talk to him.

09:11.227 --> 09:12.627
See if Xiaoxia's ready.

09:12.867 --> 09:14.387
Dad, I'm leaving.

09:15.107 --> 09:16.107
Off you go.

09:18.257 --> 09:19.657
What's up?

09:19.897 --> 09:21.513
I just called mom.

09:21.537 --> 09:23.587
I'm thinking about seeing Hulu next month.

09:23.777 --> 09:25.417
She asked me to talk to you.

09:25.467 --> 09:26.817
Sure, welcome.

09:27.707 --> 09:28.937
I'll book a ticket then.

09:29.467 --> 09:30.257
Please call me directly

09:30.257 --> 09:31.987
the next time.

09:31.987 --> 09:33.137
Stop calling my mom

09:33.137 --> 09:34.507
and Xiaoxia, okay?

09:34.827 --> 09:35.843
Well, I...

09:35.867 --> 09:37.537
it's just...

09:37.537 --> 09:38.843
Are you seeing someone now?

09:38.867 --> 09:39.867
No!

09:40.187 --> 09:41.987
Why would I do that?

09:42.187 --> 09:43.657
I thought you have a girlfriend now.

09:43.657 --> 09:45.537
And you don't want to piss her off.

09:46.347 --> 09:47.897
I'm afraid you'd be mad at me.

09:48.107 --> 09:49.163
That's not necessary.

09:49.187 --> 09:50.017
I'd never be mad at you

09:50.017 --> 09:51.817
for Hulu's sake.

09:52.187 --> 09:53.347
By the way, Luo Quan,

09:53.737 --> 09:55.067
we divorced three years ago.

09:55.067 --> 09:56.617
You can get a girlfriend

09:56.617 --> 09:58.017
or even get married if you want.

09:58.017 --> 10:00.497
I've talked to Hulu about it.

10:00.497 --> 10:02.147
Don't worry about that.

10:02.777 --> 10:04.537
Do you have a boyfriend now?

10:04.617 --> 10:06.057
Mind your own business.

10:06.137 --> 10:06.993
That's it.

10:07.017 --> 10:08.283
I'm heading to work.

10:08.307 --> 10:10.107
Remember me to your parents.

10:10.137 --> 10:11.227
Take care of yourself.

10:11.227 --> 10:12.417
Don't work too hard.

10:12.657 --> 10:13.657
You too.

10:13.707 --> 10:14.707
Got to go.

10:27.187 --> 10:28.017
The orange juice

10:28.017 --> 10:30.323
is on me, for free.

10:30.347 --> 10:31.867
I'll give you the fruit platter

10:31.867 --> 10:34.057
when you finish the desserts.

10:34.137 --> 10:35.947
The kids should not have too many sweets.

10:35.947 --> 10:37.267
Do you understand?

10:44.067 --> 10:44.617
What's wrong?

10:44.617 --> 10:46.563
Why are you so gloomy?

10:46.587 --> 10:48.747
Tuotuo is leaving.

10:48.867 --> 10:49.617
Where to?

10:49.617 --> 10:51.657
Somewhere very far away.

10:51.657 --> 10:53.537
My dad will drive a cab there.

10:53.537 --> 10:55.587
My mom will sell flowers.

10:58.617 --> 10:59.947
It's okay.

10:59.947 --> 11:01.947
You can still call each other.

11:01.947 --> 11:03.187
Tuotuo could come here

11:03.187 --> 11:04.467
during vacations.

11:04.467 --> 11:05.947
You can still hang out together.

11:05.947 --> 11:06.587
But now,

11:06.587 --> 11:08.657
we play together every day.

11:08.707 --> 11:09.307
Why can't you

11:09.307 --> 11:10.737
stay at home?

11:10.737 --> 11:13.017
Your grandparents stay here.

11:13.017 --> 11:16.017
That's right. Why do you have to go?

11:28.587 --> 11:31.107
It's not that far.

11:31.107 --> 11:32.777
My dad, grandpa, grandma,

11:32.777 --> 11:34.897
Uncle Yao's wife and his father,

11:34.897 --> 11:35.737
Uncle Yuan,

11:35.737 --> 11:37.507
they all live there.

11:37.537 --> 11:39.347
Sister Nana is right.

11:39.347 --> 11:40.897
We can call each other.

11:40.897 --> 11:43.163
Are we will friends?

11:43.187 --> 11:44.187
Yes, we are.

11:44.347 --> 11:46.537
Promise you won't have other best friends.

11:46.537 --> 11:47.187
I promise.

11:47.187 --> 11:48.227
You are my best friends.

11:48.227 --> 11:50.497
My only three best friends.

11:50.497 --> 11:51.803
Really?

11:51.827 --> 11:55.507
Am I your best friend?

12:19.867 --> 12:22.257
It's okay. Stop crying.

12:22.257 --> 12:23.777
Let's have some desserts.

12:42.777 --> 12:44.817
Did someone beat Guobao?

12:46.657 --> 12:48.467
There, there.

12:48.537 --> 12:49.307
Calm down.

12:49.307 --> 12:50.777
There, there.

12:51.377 --> 12:52.377
Here I am!

12:53.737 --> 12:55.283
Iced Americano double shot, right?

12:55.307 --> 12:56.307
In a minute.

12:59.947 --> 13:01.537
Who's that?

13:03.107 --> 13:03.707
Ponytail?

13:03.707 --> 13:04.227
What happened?

13:04.227 --> 13:05.897
He's crying badly.

13:06.347 --> 13:07.227
You'll never know.

13:07.227 --> 13:08.627
Kids are so unpredictable.

13:10.657 --> 13:11.657
By the way,

13:11.737 --> 13:13.227
on my way from the cafe,

13:13.227 --> 13:14.067
I saw Xu Hongdou

13:14.067 --> 13:16.227
writing an employee manual there.

13:16.257 --> 13:18.083
Are you guys serious?

13:18.107 --> 13:19.843
She's taking a holiday here.

13:19.867 --> 13:20.497
What about now?

13:20.497 --> 13:21.587
She's working for you

13:21.587 --> 13:22.657
free of charge.

13:22.827 --> 13:24.347
That's beyond me.

13:24.347 --> 13:26.347
Mr. Xie talked to her.

13:29.657 --> 13:30.777
Now I see.

13:30.827 --> 13:32.203
Never trust a man's word.

13:32.227 --> 13:33.753
He can be deceiving.

13:33.777 --> 13:35.387
Says a man, huh?

13:35.417 --> 13:36.737
Are you jealous of Mr. Xie

13:36.737 --> 13:37.777
because Hongodu prefers Mr. Xie

13:37.777 --> 13:38.897
over you?

13:39.617 --> 13:40.777
You've got the point.

13:40.827 --> 13:42.467
None of you talks to me.

13:42.587 --> 13:43.747
I am angry.

14:18.827 --> 14:19.827
Jiahui.

14:20.377 --> 14:22.057
Having dinner? Good.

14:22.467 --> 14:23.777
Stop running.

14:39.067 --> 14:40.387
Oh, dear!

14:40.897 --> 14:43.347
Meditating with your eyes open!

14:43.737 --> 14:44.777
Mr. Ma.

14:45.067 --> 14:47.107
You're almost there!

14:51.107 --> 14:52.107
Jiahui.

14:52.947 --> 14:54.387
Have some water.

14:56.187 --> 14:57.227
Aunt Gui.

14:58.347 --> 14:59.387
Tea?

15:00.587 --> 15:02.587
Sure, get me some.

15:06.467 --> 15:07.467
Hongdou.

15:08.347 --> 15:09.307
Let's take a break.

15:09.307 --> 15:10.513
Mr. Ma is making tea.

15:10.537 --> 15:11.537
Come over.

15:11.617 --> 15:12.617
Sure.

15:23.187 --> 15:24.187
Hongdou.

15:24.227 --> 15:25.563
I heard that

15:25.587 --> 15:27.267
you're tending the shop for Yao.

15:27.347 --> 15:28.987
Will you stay here?

15:28.987 --> 15:30.067
No, no.

15:30.067 --> 15:31.497
I'm a volunteer.

15:31.497 --> 15:32.593
I work for free.

15:32.617 --> 15:33.987
I'm helping him out.

15:34.137 --> 15:35.507
Help him out?

15:36.417 --> 15:37.627
Good for you.

15:37.737 --> 15:40.297
We all need to work.

15:41.257 --> 15:43.057
Laziness is a disease.

15:46.987 --> 15:48.147
That's an innuendo.

15:48.987 --> 15:49.617
Have some tea.

15:49.617 --> 15:50.777
Thank you.

15:58.187 --> 15:59.417
It smells great.

16:00.137 --> 16:01.387
Tastes good.

16:01.867 --> 16:03.057
Taste like tea,

16:03.187 --> 16:04.777
the way it should be.

16:09.707 --> 16:11.107
Aunt Gui,

16:11.107 --> 16:12.697
I sense Zen wisdom from your words.

16:13.377 --> 16:14.467
It's a cup of tea.

16:15.017 --> 16:16.817
That's what it should be.

16:18.347 --> 16:20.897
I only have a primary school degree.
I'm not well-educated.

16:20.897 --> 16:22.587
Don't mock me.

16:22.897 --> 16:24.987
Your words are full of wisdom.

16:27.067 --> 16:29.587
It's so hard to understand what he says.

16:29.867 --> 16:30.683
I understand.

16:30.707 --> 16:32.537
It is strenuous to communicate with me.

16:32.587 --> 16:33.987
I understand

16:34.017 --> 16:35.017
if you don't like me.

16:35.497 --> 16:36.587
Hongdou.

16:36.947 --> 16:39.147
Isn't that funny?

16:40.467 --> 16:42.347
We all eat grains.

16:42.347 --> 16:44.987
Burping, farting, and grinding teeth
are all parts of our lives.

16:45.137 --> 16:47.867
We should spend our day working.

16:47.947 --> 16:50.057
We can never rest.

16:50.377 --> 16:52.467
We must take good care of the elderly

16:52.467 --> 16:54.417
and the children.

16:54.417 --> 16:56.267
Living is painstaking.

16:56.987 --> 16:59.257
One day, you're buried three feet under.

16:59.377 --> 17:00.977
Then, you can finally rest.

17:00.977 --> 17:01.977
Am I right?

17:05.507 --> 17:06.307
In our village,

17:06.307 --> 17:07.827
people at your age,

17:07.827 --> 17:09.937
their kids are in middle school now.

17:10.217 --> 17:12.787
Why would someone squander his time
sitting there?

17:12.937 --> 17:13.547
You cannot support your family

17:13.547 --> 17:15.387
by sitting there.

17:17.897 --> 17:19.787
That's one way of thinking.

17:20.377 --> 17:21.587
However,

17:21.617 --> 17:22.507
as long as someone

17:22.507 --> 17:24.027
can live on his own

17:24.137 --> 17:26.147
without harming others,

17:26.697 --> 17:27.787
he has the right

17:27.787 --> 17:28.507
to live his life

17:28.507 --> 17:30.137
the way he likes freely.

17:30.137 --> 17:31.137
Right?

17:31.347 --> 17:33.257
Talking about freedom.

17:33.937 --> 17:35.627
If you are an orphan,

17:36.267 --> 17:37.177
you could be free,

17:37.177 --> 17:39.387
doing whatever you want.

17:40.457 --> 17:42.177
Otherwise,

17:42.177 --> 17:44.497
you must think about your parents.

17:45.137 --> 17:46.217
If you rest,

17:46.217 --> 17:48.257
they have to work hard.

17:48.377 --> 17:50.067
If you sit here,

17:50.107 --> 17:52.867
then they have to run for a living.

17:55.417 --> 17:57.113
People from the outside like you

17:57.137 --> 17:58.137
always say

17:58.137 --> 17:59.137
you want a free life

17:59.137 --> 18:00.377
as long as you obey the law.

18:00.377 --> 18:02.457
You can do whatever you want.

18:03.787 --> 18:05.547
Here's the question.

18:07.507 --> 18:09.547
What if you're starving?

18:10.347 --> 18:12.387
Who will take care of you?

18:13.507 --> 18:14.977
No one but your parents.

18:14.977 --> 18:16.723
What if you get old and get ill,

18:16.747 --> 18:19.387
if there's an emergency,

18:19.417 --> 18:21.027
you'll need money.

18:21.507 --> 18:23.587
But you don't have any.

18:23.897 --> 18:25.027
Then what?

18:25.747 --> 18:28.497
It's too late.

18:33.787 --> 18:34.827
Aunt Gui.

18:35.937 --> 18:37.697
I profit more from talking to you

18:38.067 --> 18:39.547
than reading for ten years.

18:40.937 --> 18:42.867
It's just chitchat.

18:42.867 --> 18:45.547
Don't take it seriously.

18:46.867 --> 18:49.803
You've made your point clearly.

18:49.827 --> 18:51.027
I shall not waste the nourishment.

18:51.027 --> 18:52.497
Or it's like cows eating roses.

18:53.827 --> 18:56.347
Why would a cow eat roses?

18:58.867 --> 19:00.137
Why would a cow...

19:00.137 --> 19:01.937
That doesn't matter.

19:02.547 --> 19:04.307
What the cow eats doesn't matter, either.

19:04.867 --> 19:06.307
What I'm saying is,

19:06.547 --> 19:08.003
I am sitting right here

19:08.027 --> 19:11.417
so as to go against my diligence.

19:11.617 --> 19:13.547
Remaining motionless against all motions.

19:18.137 --> 19:19.937
Can you get it?

19:25.417 --> 19:26.393
I see your mouth moving.

19:26.417 --> 19:28.027
But the words put together

19:28.697 --> 19:30.107
doesn't quite make sense.

19:32.137 --> 19:33.457
To sum up,

19:33.897 --> 19:35.347
Pareto principle applies

19:35.417 --> 19:36.627
to everything.

19:36.937 --> 19:38.563
For many things,

19:38.587 --> 19:39.867
even if you try so hard

19:39.867 --> 19:41.107
and devote yourself to it,

19:41.107 --> 19:42.217
in the end,

19:42.657 --> 19:44.587
all your efforts go in vain.

19:44.827 --> 19:46.697
It's pointless anyway.

19:46.697 --> 19:48.523
Then why bother at all?

19:48.547 --> 19:49.547
Well.

19:49.977 --> 19:51.083
Why not

19:51.107 --> 19:52.417
cope with all motions

19:53.107 --> 19:55.547
by remaining motionless?

19:55.977 --> 19:58.307
That's the smart move.

20:02.937 --> 20:04.937
Now I get it.

20:05.867 --> 20:07.067
Turns out,

20:07.377 --> 20:08.867
you're talking to the wrong person.

20:08.897 --> 20:11.457
I couldn't help you.

20:14.107 --> 20:15.657
In our life,

20:16.747 --> 20:18.457
we're born with nothing on.

20:18.457 --> 20:21.147
When we die, we take nothing with us.

20:21.417 --> 20:23.147
It's a hard life.

20:24.067 --> 20:24.937
But you cannot end your life

20:24.937 --> 20:28.177
because you're going to die in the end.

20:29.617 --> 20:31.897
Except for the air you're breathing,

20:31.897 --> 20:32.977
everything else

20:32.977 --> 20:34.387
comes at a price.

20:34.787 --> 20:36.457
Can you remain motionless?

20:37.937 --> 20:39.827
If you can't,

20:39.897 --> 20:41.763
go get a job!

20:41.787 --> 20:44.417
You don't have to be the boss.

20:48.457 --> 20:50.107
What's more,

20:50.347 --> 20:52.387
what if you are a boss,

20:52.457 --> 20:54.003
a billionaire

20:54.027 --> 20:56.697
making countless money.

20:57.457 --> 20:58.867
The money you make

21:00.027 --> 21:02.177
can fill the entire yard here.

21:02.177 --> 21:04.417
Even with money to burn,

21:06.137 --> 21:08.147
here's my question,

21:09.067 --> 21:11.627
what if you die?

21:12.867 --> 21:15.657
Can you take them with you?

21:18.417 --> 21:21.107
They are meaningless to a dead person.

21:21.417 --> 21:23.307
Taoist paper effigies,

21:23.747 --> 21:25.507
cars, houses, villas,

21:25.507 --> 21:26.787
paper dolls,

21:26.787 --> 21:29.587
banknotes of hundreds of billions.

21:29.587 --> 21:31.627
You name it.

21:31.897 --> 21:34.523
It won't cost a fortune.

21:34.547 --> 21:35.867
Your posterity

21:35.867 --> 21:37.937
can light them up for you.

21:38.457 --> 21:39.547
Right?

21:52.547 --> 21:54.347
I hate talking about this.

21:54.347 --> 21:55.307
It's just small talk.

21:55.307 --> 21:56.787
Don't be so serious.

21:56.937 --> 21:58.657
So much talking.

21:58.787 --> 22:00.587
I should get back to work.

22:01.457 --> 22:02.433
Come on.

22:02.457 --> 22:03.627
Stay here.

22:04.347 --> 22:06.737
Xiaohei! Don't step on my flowers.

22:08.617 --> 22:10.217
Wisdom.

22:14.547 --> 22:15.587
Classics.

22:16.787 --> 22:17.897
I'm enlightened.

22:25.787 --> 22:27.977
Let's have some tea.

22:51.867 --> 22:54.147
[Working at full speed.]

22:56.187 --> 22:59.527
[Chapter 126]

25:24.547 --> 25:25.483
Damai!

25:25.507 --> 25:27.027
You scared me.

25:27.867 --> 25:28.867
Mr. Ma.

25:29.977 --> 25:30.977
Food?

25:31.937 --> 25:33.307
What are you making?

25:33.347 --> 25:34.457
Rice noodles.

25:34.617 --> 25:36.387
Stumbled rice noodles.

25:37.217 --> 25:38.587
Scrambled rice noodles?

25:44.217 --> 25:45.497
Fried beef with scrambled eggs?

25:45.977 --> 25:47.067
Nope.

25:48.067 --> 25:50.497
A horse stumbles.

25:50.657 --> 25:52.267
My last name means horse.

25:52.267 --> 25:54.417
So, stumbled rice noodles.

25:57.417 --> 25:58.417
Noodles?

25:58.787 --> 25:59.563
Yes, please.

25:59.587 --> 26:00.627
Thank you.

26:09.347 --> 26:11.457
Running out of inspiration for writing?

26:13.897 --> 26:16.217
Where is your pressure from?

26:21.507 --> 26:24.027
Comments, income.

26:24.027 --> 26:25.657
I don't know what to write!

26:26.217 --> 26:27.897
Why is that?

26:28.617 --> 26:31.347
Comments and income.

26:31.377 --> 26:32.737
It's a vicious spiral.

26:34.177 --> 26:35.497
Do your family support you?

26:35.547 --> 26:36.747
My mom does.

26:36.747 --> 26:38.217
But my dad doesn't.

26:40.747 --> 26:43.217
Does he think it's not stable?

26:45.107 --> 26:46.267
It's more than that.

26:46.267 --> 26:47.627
He thinks it's humiliating.

26:49.027 --> 26:50.697
Writing is humiliating?

26:51.347 --> 26:52.697
Why?

26:53.547 --> 26:56.177
When I started with web novels,

26:56.177 --> 26:57.177
I wrote some fan fictions

26:57.177 --> 26:59.347
with explicit scenes.

26:59.547 --> 27:00.107
Later,

27:00.107 --> 27:01.457
I became a full-time web writer.

27:01.457 --> 27:03.433
My cousin, who was in grade nine,

27:03.457 --> 27:04.457
found those fan fictions

27:04.457 --> 27:06.217
when searching for my work.

27:06.217 --> 27:08.217
Then, she showed it to her classmates.

27:08.267 --> 27:09.633
The entire class read it.

27:09.657 --> 27:10.307
To make it worse,

27:10.307 --> 27:11.873
she showed off that her cousin wrote it.

27:11.897 --> 27:12.507
Later,

27:12.507 --> 27:14.267
her head teacher knew it.

27:14.267 --> 27:16.307
She found out what was going on

27:16.307 --> 27:18.523
and talked to her colleague, Mr. Zhou.

27:18.547 --> 27:20.257
That is my father.

27:21.617 --> 27:22.617
He gained fame

27:22.617 --> 27:23.787
thanks to me.

27:25.827 --> 27:27.867
But as I become a full-time writer,

27:27.867 --> 27:29.507
I quit writing fan fiction.

27:29.507 --> 27:30.897
I start to write original fiction,

27:30.897 --> 27:32.547
mystery and love fiction.

27:32.587 --> 27:34.497
Still, my father is against it.

27:34.867 --> 27:35.937
I graduated from a normal university.

27:35.937 --> 27:36.507
He always wants me

27:36.507 --> 27:38.307
to be a primary school teacher.

27:38.307 --> 27:39.587
It's more popular in the marriage market.

27:39.587 --> 27:41.737
And I get two vacations every year.

27:43.417 --> 27:44.977
Out of parental love,

27:45.897 --> 27:46.827
your parents

27:46.827 --> 27:48.787
make a long-term plan for you.

27:51.937 --> 27:52.937
Damai.

27:53.347 --> 27:54.657
Here's my advice.

27:55.787 --> 27:59.193
If we keep lowering our heads

27:59.217 --> 28:00.657
and following our parents' footsteps

28:00.657 --> 28:02.003
while marching forward,

28:02.027 --> 28:04.147
we can achieve nothing new.

28:05.587 --> 28:08.177
You have to find your own way.

28:11.217 --> 28:12.657
Even if

28:12.787 --> 28:14.257
it will be a path

28:14.787 --> 28:18.737
full of thorns and obstacles.

28:19.547 --> 28:21.267
What's worse, there might be tigers and wolves

28:21.267 --> 28:22.827
lurking in the darkness.

28:23.897 --> 28:25.257
But, don't worry.

28:26.747 --> 28:28.347
It won't always be like that.

28:29.977 --> 28:32.027
Every dog has its day.

28:32.897 --> 28:33.937
One day,

28:33.937 --> 28:35.547
you'll see cows and sheep

28:35.547 --> 28:37.307
with flowers blooming on the ground.

28:37.347 --> 28:41.737
You'll march on horseback, singing.

28:43.747 --> 28:44.657
Mr. Ma.

28:44.657 --> 28:46.737
Will there be flowers if I stick to them?

28:46.787 --> 28:49.697
Watch the grass and the woods.

28:49.697 --> 28:51.347
What about flowers?

28:54.107 --> 28:55.107
Alright.

28:55.307 --> 28:56.243
Wash your hands.

28:56.267 --> 28:57.387
Get a bowl.

29:33.827 --> 29:34.827
Tasty!

29:37.457 --> 29:38.897
I'm waiting for that.

29:40.177 --> 29:40.867
Mr. Ma.

29:40.867 --> 29:41.937
You haven't answered me.

29:41.937 --> 29:43.307
Will there be flowers?

29:44.507 --> 29:45.737
Don't talk while eating.

30:34.347 --> 30:35.347
Now it's time.

30:35.347 --> 30:36.827
Your flowering path.

30:37.177 --> 30:38.417
Flowering path?

30:40.417 --> 30:41.657
Flowering path!

30:43.417 --> 30:45.177
There are certain topics

30:45.457 --> 30:47.347
only for replete people,

30:48.027 --> 30:49.497
especially when it's late at night.

30:50.067 --> 30:51.737
When it's in all silence,

30:53.107 --> 30:55.067
when most creatures go to sleep,

30:55.747 --> 30:58.387
when you let your guard down,

30:58.827 --> 31:00.697
replenish some energy.

31:02.067 --> 31:03.217
How pleasant!

31:10.587 --> 31:12.347
To tell you the truth,

31:14.217 --> 31:19.627
you can't always find a flowering path.

31:21.587 --> 31:23.067
Take my...

31:26.377 --> 31:27.937
my friend as an example,

31:29.107 --> 31:30.867
he used to be arrogant,

31:32.507 --> 31:33.827
thinking he could achieve

31:33.977 --> 31:36.147
anything if he wants to.

31:37.067 --> 31:38.897
When the internet industry starts to thrive,

31:39.107 --> 31:40.897
he took part in many careers.

31:43.027 --> 31:45.067
He was opportunistic

31:45.177 --> 31:46.497
and was very lucky.

31:46.587 --> 31:48.307
He always got away

31:48.307 --> 31:50.737
before the recessions.

31:52.347 --> 31:54.547
His wealth kept snowballing.

31:55.307 --> 31:56.347
Arrogant as he was,

31:56.507 --> 31:57.657
he rented several floors

31:58.067 --> 32:03.217
at the most luxurious science park in Beijing.

32:03.747 --> 32:04.937
It was over 10,000 square kilometers.

32:05.457 --> 32:06.897
He hired hundreds of employees.

32:07.217 --> 32:08.897
He wanted to do it in a big way.

32:09.217 --> 32:11.697
He invested all his money.

32:15.067 --> 32:16.497
This time, he failed.

32:20.457 --> 32:21.507
He lost all the money

32:21.507 --> 32:23.627
he earned over the past years.

32:24.897 --> 32:26.083
He sold his villa

32:26.107 --> 32:28.657
and his limo for money.

32:30.307 --> 32:32.217
Thankfully, he has a conscience.

32:32.457 --> 32:35.067
He paid all the wages

32:35.417 --> 32:40.027
and managed to pay all the final payments.

32:42.867 --> 32:44.627
In the end,

32:46.307 --> 32:48.387
he did the accounts.

32:48.457 --> 32:49.283
Over the past years,

32:49.307 --> 32:50.307
he didn't even make a penny.

32:53.457 --> 32:55.547
What's he doing now?

32:56.617 --> 32:58.417
Nothing at all.

33:00.217 --> 33:01.547
Before,

33:01.937 --> 33:03.627
he was looking at the world.

33:05.267 --> 33:07.697
Now, he's examining himself.

33:09.027 --> 33:11.067
Staying away from the outside,

33:12.867 --> 33:15.867
and trying to collect his strength

33:15.977 --> 33:17.137
to suppress his restless desire

33:17.137 --> 33:19.547
to start up again.

33:20.657 --> 33:22.177
He still wants to start up a business?

33:22.177 --> 33:23.457
Isn't that funny?

33:24.177 --> 33:27.043
If it's someone else,

33:27.067 --> 33:28.417
he'd quit already.

33:29.897 --> 33:31.027
But him?

33:32.107 --> 33:37.457
The fire in his heart

33:38.937 --> 33:41.307
is still flaming.

33:41.787 --> 33:44.147
He's reluctant to work for others.

33:45.417 --> 33:46.787
All he does now

33:47.347 --> 33:48.937
is sit still.

33:54.027 --> 33:56.107
Starting up a business

33:56.107 --> 33:57.867
is the only thing that interests him.

34:02.667 --> 34:04.297
It's the same for me.

34:04.497 --> 34:08.107
I'm only interested in writing.

34:10.147 --> 34:13.547
But we must face the reality.

34:16.867 --> 34:18.337
Face the reality?

34:20.057 --> 34:21.907
What reality?

34:22.577 --> 34:25.507
A 28-year-old unknown writer

34:26.227 --> 34:28.377
with few subscribers,

34:28.867 --> 34:30.657
being heavily plagiarized,

34:30.977 --> 34:32.467
receiving countless mean comments,

34:32.707 --> 34:34.427
questioned by her parents.

34:34.707 --> 34:38.217
His future is dark.

34:42.667 --> 34:44.297
Poor her.

34:46.497 --> 34:49.187
It reminds me of my friend's parents' comment

34:49.187 --> 34:51.297
on his career.

34:52.187 --> 34:53.257
What's that?

34:56.227 --> 34:57.227
I'd rather you be a beggar

34:57.227 --> 34:58.987
than do this.

35:04.227 --> 35:05.907
For real?

35:08.867 --> 35:10.377
So much for this.

35:10.377 --> 35:11.587
Period.

35:12.937 --> 35:14.257
Taste the tea.

35:40.867 --> 35:50.867
[Artisan Woodcarving Workshop]

36:25.577 --> 36:26.707
We've made improvements

36:26.707 --> 36:27.627
to the woodcarving workshop.

36:27.627 --> 36:29.323
We want to make it a personal brand

36:29.347 --> 36:30.147
and build connections between the customers

36:30.147 --> 36:31.347
and the woodcarvings.

36:31.347 --> 36:33.777
It's more than a woodcarving store.

36:33.827 --> 36:34.347
Our online shop

36:34.347 --> 36:35.977
with short advertising videos

36:35.977 --> 36:37.857
will be our major sales channel.

36:38.457 --> 36:39.457
Good.

36:40.977 --> 36:42.377
I'm not good at this.

36:42.377 --> 36:43.417
I entrust it to you.

36:43.417 --> 36:44.283
Do it your way.

36:44.307 --> 36:45.307
Okay?

36:47.977 --> 36:48.987
Finished?

36:49.307 --> 36:50.147
Let's head outside.

36:50.147 --> 36:51.123
Sure.

36:51.147 --> 36:52.147
Come on.

36:57.667 --> 36:58.737
Xiaoxia.

36:59.307 --> 37:00.507
Come over, please.

37:02.787 --> 37:03.347
Take your seat.

37:03.347 --> 37:04.347
Okay.

37:04.827 --> 37:05.667
Xiaoxia.

37:05.667 --> 37:06.937
Do you host live streaming?

37:06.937 --> 37:07.603
I do.

37:07.627 --> 37:08.803
But I have few viewers.

37:08.827 --> 37:09.627
It's okay.

37:09.627 --> 37:11.377
We were just like you.

37:11.457 --> 37:12.657
Take your seat.

37:14.267 --> 37:15.827
I've talked to Master Xie.

37:15.827 --> 37:16.417
You should keep on

37:16.417 --> 37:17.817
with your live streaming.

37:17.867 --> 37:18.937
Now,

37:18.937 --> 37:20.017
Yue has registered multiple accounts

37:20.017 --> 37:21.347
for the woodcarving workshop.

37:21.347 --> 37:22.937
She'd shoots footage occasionally

37:22.937 --> 37:24.337
for short videos.

37:24.377 --> 37:25.867
What's more,

37:25.867 --> 37:28.347
there will be a master-apprentice themed
short video,

37:28.347 --> 37:30.337
where you shoot videos for your master.

37:30.897 --> 37:31.283
Great!

37:31.307 --> 37:31.827
No, no.

37:31.827 --> 37:33.107
I don't agree.

37:33.147 --> 37:34.097
Why shoot me?

37:34.097 --> 37:36.097
Take it easy, Master Xie.

37:36.097 --> 37:37.147
There is no script or plot.

37:37.147 --> 37:39.243
It records your daily life.

37:39.267 --> 37:40.667
I don't talk much.

37:40.667 --> 37:41.667
Xiaoxia.

37:41.747 --> 37:43.097
Yao, how about this?

37:43.097 --> 37:44.897
Look at me.

37:44.897 --> 37:46.097
It would receive many audiences.

37:46.097 --> 37:47.737
I don't know what to say.

37:47.937 --> 37:49.057
You heard her.

37:49.057 --> 37:49.897
It records your daily life.

37:49.897 --> 37:50.747
You don't have to do anything.

37:50.747 --> 37:52.473
They will edit it later.

37:52.497 --> 37:53.323
I don't like it.

37:53.347 --> 37:55.107
It's pointless.

37:56.097 --> 37:56.953
Put it down.

37:56.977 --> 37:57.987
Turn it off!

37:58.057 --> 37:58.953
Do you hear me?

37:58.977 --> 37:59.867
Turn that off!

37:59.867 --> 38:00.867
Come on.

38:01.457 --> 38:02.393
Look at him.

38:02.417 --> 38:04.353
He's really interested in making videos.

38:04.377 --> 38:05.227
If you could work harder

38:05.227 --> 38:06.417
at wood carving,

38:06.417 --> 38:08.657
you'd be much better now!

38:09.147 --> 38:10.507
Master, I love you.

38:16.537 --> 38:17.393
Get lost.

38:17.417 --> 38:19.107
That's stupid.

38:19.457 --> 38:20.857
Stop shooting! Turn it off.

38:21.187 --> 38:21.937
Look at him.

38:21.937 --> 38:22.707
Take a seat.

38:22.707 --> 38:23.307
I can't believe it.

38:23.307 --> 38:23.667
Master, sit down.

38:23.667 --> 38:25.427
He gets sidetracked easily.

38:26.937 --> 38:28.473
Excellent!

38:28.497 --> 38:29.057
I mean it!

38:29.057 --> 38:30.347
I'll edit the footage

38:30.347 --> 38:31.577
and add some text animations.

38:31.577 --> 38:33.057
The theme would be

38:33.057 --> 38:35.947
hit me once more, Master.

38:39.417 --> 38:40.747
Stop laughing!

38:40.747 --> 38:41.747
Get inside!

38:42.057 --> 38:43.547
Send the footage to me.

38:44.497 --> 38:46.257
Yao, have some water.

38:46.457 --> 38:48.177
I need to answer this.

38:49.417 --> 38:50.417
What's up?

38:51.827 --> 38:53.107
I'm free now.

38:54.577 --> 38:54.977
Yeah, sure.

38:54.977 --> 38:56.377
Coming to you now.

38:57.187 --> 38:58.803
There's a meeting next door.

38:58.827 --> 38:59.827
Sure. Go ahead.

39:00.147 --> 39:01.217
Watch your step.

39:10.307 --> 39:11.947
Here's our employee manual.

39:12.147 --> 39:12.747
Manager Xiaochun

39:12.747 --> 39:14.377
and President Xie approved it.

39:14.747 --> 39:16.547
You may take a look.

39:22.747 --> 39:23.377
Granny Caiyun,

39:23.377 --> 39:24.057
it's okay

39:24.057 --> 39:25.147
if you can't read it.

39:25.147 --> 39:26.827
I'll explain it to you.

39:26.827 --> 39:28.457
It's very simple.

39:28.457 --> 39:29.747
In this manual

39:29.747 --> 39:31.953
are orientation and guidance

39:31.977 --> 39:33.827
on assessment, wage,

39:33.827 --> 39:34.873
vacation,

39:34.897 --> 39:35.843
insurance,

39:35.867 --> 39:38.433
and dismission.

39:38.457 --> 39:40.107
These are the rules.

39:40.347 --> 39:42.337
There's an attendance bonus!

39:42.457 --> 39:44.427
What does that mean?

39:44.707 --> 39:45.977
An attendance bonus.

39:45.977 --> 39:47.267
In short, you'd get a bonus

39:47.267 --> 39:49.347
if you don't show up late

39:49.347 --> 39:50.987
or leave early.

39:51.227 --> 39:52.163
Granny.

39:52.187 --> 39:54.987
The bonus is 200 yuan per month!

39:55.147 --> 39:56.947
200 yuan?

39:57.627 --> 40:00.147
What if there's an emergency?

40:00.377 --> 40:01.897
I wrote it in the manual.

40:01.897 --> 40:02.867
You can ask for leave

40:02.867 --> 40:04.433
three times a month.

40:04.457 --> 40:05.747
If it's less than three times,

40:05.747 --> 40:07.513
you can still get your bonus.

40:07.537 --> 40:08.897
Four times or more,

40:08.897 --> 40:10.097
you'd lose it.

40:10.097 --> 40:11.827
Besides, you'd get a deduction

40:11.827 --> 40:13.067
based on the time you leave.

40:13.267 --> 40:15.427
If you want the bonus,

40:15.537 --> 40:16.667
you cannot ask for leaves

40:16.667 --> 40:17.737
as you used to do.

40:19.417 --> 40:20.587
Xiuying.

40:20.707 --> 40:22.697
The bonus is 200 yuan.

40:22.747 --> 40:25.697
We should not leave at will again.

40:25.977 --> 40:28.307
That's extra 200 yuan!

40:28.307 --> 40:29.947
Exactly!

40:31.827 --> 40:32.307
What if

40:32.307 --> 40:34.033
I leave some corn to dry in the yards,

40:34.057 --> 40:35.873
and it starts to rain?

40:35.897 --> 40:37.177
What should I do?

40:37.627 --> 40:38.843
We can ask for leave

40:38.867 --> 40:40.427
three times a month.

40:40.627 --> 40:42.777
We can take turns.

40:43.187 --> 40:44.507
That's right.

40:49.627 --> 40:51.097
I'm sending this manual

40:51.097 --> 40:53.513
to Ye Sen for typesetting.

40:53.537 --> 40:54.147
Then,

40:54.147 --> 40:55.347
we'll make a formal version

40:55.347 --> 40:56.513
and print it out.

40:56.537 --> 40:57.227
From then on,

40:57.227 --> 40:58.643
all our employees

40:58.667 --> 41:00.283
should stick to the manual.

41:00.307 --> 41:00.667
Okay?

41:00.667 --> 41:01.393
Sure.

41:01.417 --> 41:01.827
Don't forget it.

41:01.827 --> 41:03.177
It's Manager Xu from Beijing

41:03.307 --> 41:05.177
who come up with this.

41:05.707 --> 41:07.147
Yeah. I'm the bad cop.

41:07.147 --> 41:09.627
I won't be staying here for long.

41:09.627 --> 41:11.177
I'd be leaving shortly.

41:13.827 --> 41:14.947
Xu Hongdou.

41:16.707 --> 41:18.297
I'm almost in love with you.

41:18.977 --> 41:20.857
What's your problem?

41:25.667 --> 41:27.257
There, there.

41:27.747 --> 41:29.337
Don't cry.

41:29.667 --> 41:30.737
I'll check on that.

41:31.827 --> 41:33.187
What's going on?

41:33.187 --> 41:34.057
What happened?

41:34.057 --> 41:35.627
Calm down.

41:35.667 --> 41:37.017
There, there.

41:37.017 --> 41:38.513
No idea.

41:38.537 --> 41:40.027
Stop crying.

41:40.897 --> 41:41.763
Did he...

41:41.787 --> 41:43.147
The wipe is dry.

41:43.147 --> 41:43.867
Is he hungry?

41:43.867 --> 41:44.627
I don't think so.

41:44.627 --> 41:46.507
I just fed him.

41:46.627 --> 41:48.537
My mom and nanny are shopping.

41:48.537 --> 41:49.947
I'm not good at this.

41:51.057 --> 41:52.507
Granny Caiyun.

41:53.827 --> 41:55.217
Come over, please.

41:56.787 --> 41:57.873
The baby's crying.

41:57.897 --> 41:59.393
Let me see.

41:59.417 --> 42:00.683
Don't know what's going on.

42:00.707 --> 42:02.427
What happened?

42:04.977 --> 42:06.657
The baby is crying.

42:07.827 --> 42:08.857
This way.

42:10.897 --> 42:11.897
Calm down.

42:11.897 --> 42:12.497
♫ I've been alone ♫

42:12.497 --> 42:13.947
The baby is about to sleep.

42:14.627 --> 42:16.427
Granny, you're good at this.

42:20.417 --> 42:21.427
Zhiyao,

42:22.417 --> 42:24.627
Hongdou's lease

42:24.787 --> 42:26.467
will be due in two months.

42:27.147 --> 42:28.257
What about it?

42:29.577 --> 42:31.147
What about it?

42:31.497 --> 42:33.467
I must remind you.

42:33.937 --> 42:35.627
Don't fall in love with her!

42:35.627 --> 42:37.777
She will leave.

42:39.307 --> 42:40.627
Come on.

42:40.667 --> 42:43.257
I'm serious!

42:43.827 --> 42:45.627
What about Huang? I meet her every day.

42:45.627 --> 42:47.033
Why don't you warn her?

42:47.057 --> 42:48.187
Just admit it!

42:48.187 --> 42:54.677
♫ I know I will be yours ♫

42:54.967 --> 43:00.437
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

43:02.407 --> 43:07.357
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

43:09.817 --> 43:15.867
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

43:16.187 --> 43:21.567
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

43:24.527 --> 43:29.917
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

43:31.897 --> 43:36.757
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

43:39.327 --> 43:45.527
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

43:45.857 --> 43:52.047
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

43:54.137 --> 44:00.457
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

44:00.577 --> 44:07.327
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

44:08.707 --> 44:10.733
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

44:10.757 --> 44:15.147
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

44:15.387 --> 44:22.617
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

